            // Trust (BMC-LANE-1 review): the arm matches BOTH spellings of each
            // wrapper. The verifier-lane extractor prints DEFINITIONAL paths
            // (`safe_def_path_str` is pinned to `with_no_visible_paths!`), so a real
            // cast names `core::ptr::non_null::NonNull` or
            // `core::num::nonzero::NonZero`; the re-exported spellings this arm
